      "text": "Summary of contributions  discovery, naming, and first analysis of Duqu – creates files with names starting with ~DQ – striking similarities to Stuxnet, but different objective – advanced cyber espionage tool (keystrokes, screen shots, files) – 60-page report shared with major AV vendors and Microsoft – ~20 known victims, mainly in Iran, but also in Europe",
