      },
      "text": "Duqu components identified Keylogger Registry data Registry data jminet7.sys (loader) cmi4432.sys (loader) netp191.pnf (payload) netp192.pnf (config) cmi4432.pnf (payload) cmi4464.pnf (config) nep191_ res302.dll netp191.zdata.",
